id: size-doesnt-matter
name: Size Doesn’t Matter
talentCategory: size
prerequisites: Miniature Warrior
description: >
  You’ve long since learned that it’s not the size of the dog in the fight that’s important, but the size of the fight in the dog.
text: >
  Size Doesn’t Matter: You’ve long since learned that it’s not the size of the dog in the fight that’s important, but the size of the fight in the dog.
  –Prerequisites: Miniature Warrior
  (1)-[Passive]: If your Size Category is Tiny or smaller, increase your Damage Reduction by 1(T).
  (2)-[Passive]: If your Size Category is Small or smaller, and you would receive Damage from an Absolute Attack that missed you, reduce that Damage by 2(bT).

---

[passive]
# (1) Tiny: 2 Size Categories below Medium.
if (size.steps <= -2) {
  damageReduction += 1(T);
}
# (2) Small: 1 below Medium. An Absolute Attack's Damage when it missed you, 2(bT) less (chat.mjs absoluteOutcome).
if (size.steps <= -1) {
  allow sizeDoesntMatter.absolute;
}
